 pattern** (0-255 without leading zeros):\n- `[0-9]|[1-9][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-5]`\n- Matches: 0, 1-9, 10-99, 100-199, 200-249, 250-255\n\n**Date pattern** (handles varying month lengths):\n- `01,03,05,07,08,10,12` (31 days): `0[13578]|1[02]`\n- `04,06,09,11` (30 days): `04|06|09|11`  \n- `02` (29 days): `02`\n- Days range appropriately per month\n\n**Overall logic**:\n- `^` - Start of line\n- `(?=.*\\b<IPv4>\\b)` - Lookahead ensuring IPv4 exists somewhere in line\n- `.*\\b(<DATE>)\\b$` - Greedy match everything, then backtrack to capture the last date before end of line\n- Capturing group extracts only the date for `re.findall()`\n- `\\b` word boundaries prevent false matches with adjacent alphanumerics","ttft_ms":95734,"type":"result","duration_ms":105175,"uuid":"2e7bdfa3-e5c2-4d6e-b646-5326ee096c99","ttft_stream_ms":1322,"time_to_request_ms":43,"queued_turn_count":0}
